# Without this, `COPY <service> ./<service>` drags the developer's local
# node_modules into the image. That masked a broken Dockerfile for a long time:
# images appeared to work locally and failed on a clean checkout.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.nx
**/coverage

# Secrets and local state must never reach an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.sqlite3

.git
.github
**/tmp
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

**/*.md
!README.md
